stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LocallyAvailable

    LocallyAvailable --> OfferEligible: shared and unseen
    OfferEligible --> OfferQueued: selected<br>expiry set, txCount++
    OfferQueued --> OfferSent: OFFER written

    OfferSent --> Requested: valid REQUEST received
    OfferSent --> Acknowledged: Peer already has<br>message and sends ACK
    OfferSent --> OfferEligible: expiry reached
    OfferSent --> OfferEligible: lower-latency<br>transport used

    Requested --> MessageEligible: expiry and txCount reset
    MessageEligible --> MessageQueued: selected<br>expiry set, txCount++
    MessageQueued --> MessageSent: MESSAGE written<br>to stream

    MessageSent --> Acknowledged: ACK received
    MessageSent --> OfferEligible: expiry reached
    MessageSent --> OfferEligible: lower-latency transport used

    OfferEligible --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible
    OfferSent --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible
    Requested --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible
    MessageSent --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible

    OfferQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed
    MessageQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed

    Acknowledged --> [*]
    NotEligible --> [*]
    SessionFailed --> [*]